From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:44:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] po: Throw to in the window menu, in nine catalogues

Throw stays Throw in every language, with its meaning in parentheses at first contact, as
kwin-throw-catch-names.patch and the KRdp successor write it.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
diff --git a/po/de/kwin.po b/po/de/kwin.po
index 4cf2a3c..b97c5be 100644
--- a/po/de/kwin.po
+++ b/po/de/kwin.po
@@ -5739,3 +5739,10 @@ msgstr "Die Konfiguration der virtuellen Leiste konnte nicht angewendet werden"
 
 msgid "Virtual panel properties are not supported"
 msgstr "Die Eigenschaften der virtuellen Leiste werden nicht unterstützt"
+
+#. Stereo Throw: the window menu lists the network screens under Throw to.
+#: src/useractions.cpp
+#, kde-format
+msgctxt "@item:inmenu the network screens (Cast devices, phones) a window can be thrown to"
+msgid "Throw &to"
+msgstr "Throw (senden) &an"
